---
title: Scout, second shape - Tasks and Skills (anything else on a schedule)
---
flowchart LR
    Person([Person<br/>iMessage or web]) --> Chat["/chat turn"]
    Chat --> Router[Routing model<br/>one tool call over backend/tools rows<br/>+ one tool per skill]
    Tools[(backend/tools<br/>registry · waiting lines)] --> Router
    Packs[(skills/ packs<br/>+ user_skills)] --> Router
    Router -->|schedule_task · manage_tasks| Save[ConversationService<br/>_apply_task_action]
    Router -->|save_skill · manage_skills| Save
    Router -->|skill__name| Again[Route the skill instruction again<br/>+ reply/skill_invoked block]
    Again --> Router
    Router --> Status[action event<br/>label · detail · waiting line]
    Status --> Person
    Locality[(Primary locality<br/>timezone)] --> Save
    Save -->|which task they mean| Picker[Routing model<br/>pick_task]
    Save --> Tasks[(scheduled_tasks<br/>instruction encrypted · cadence · next_run_at)]
    Save --> Outcome[task_outcome context<br/>+ reply/task_outcome block]
    Outcome --> Reply[Reply model<br/>words the confirmation]
    Reply --> Person

    Loop[Discovery worker process<br/>task loop] -->|enqueue due slots| Tasks
    Tasks --> Runs[(scheduled_task_runs<br/>one per slot · leased claim)]
    Runs -->|claim| Runner[TaskRunner]
    Runner -->|bearer as the person<br/>task conversation · scheduled_task mark| Fire["/chat turn<br/>+ reply/scheduled_task block"]
    Fire --> Turn[TurnResult<br/>reply · images · rendered diagrams]
    Turn -->|channel imessage| Bridge[Mac iMessage bridge<br/>bubbles and attachments]
    Bridge --> Person
    Turn -->|channel web| Runs
    Runner -->|finish: delivered · completed · failed| Runs

    classDef interface fill:#f5f5f7,stroke:#86868b,color:#1d1d1f;
    classDef application fill:#e8f1fb,stroke:#5e8fc4,color:#102a43;
    classDef data fill:#eef7ee,stroke:#5f9562,color:#183b1b;
    classDef model fill:#f1edff,stroke:#8872c6,color:#2e2450;
    class Person,Bridge interface;
    class Chat,Save,Outcome,Loop,Runner,Fire,Turn,Again,Status application;
    class Locality,Tasks,Runs,Tools,Packs data;
    class Router,Picker,Reply model;
